      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of a third and two q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds (= a twelfth).&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God for his bounties.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb for the sum owed&nbsp;through his standing surety for the estates in the town of al-Fayy\u016bm</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and four, under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Mak\u012bn al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot&eacute;g&eacute; of the commander of&nbsp;the faithful,&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: A sixth and a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d&nbsp;( = a twenty-fourth). Its amount: A third and two&nbsp;q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds (= a twelfth).&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The seventh of \u1e62afar,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and four.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
